    {
      "task_id": "external-v2-join-00",
      "prompt": "Read ledger_00.left and ledger_00.right. Use only their independently verified contents to create ledger_00.receipt with exactly {\"left\":\"left-proof-00\",\"right\":\"right-proof-00\",\"status\":\"joined\"}. Do not guess or finish until both reads and the write are verified; report left-proof-00 and right-proof-00.",
